## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Overfitting on small N | Minimum 3 errors before proposing edit; segment size 5 |
| Oscillating edits | Max 1 active edit at a time; no new edit during segment |
| Wrong direction | Bayesian prior anchored to current value; small magnitude |
| Composition knobs hard to edit | Start with numeric knobs only; composition in V2 |
